---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {settings,media,url} from '../lib/data';
---
<Layout title="A little note" active="about"><section class="about wrap narrow"><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE BEGIN</span><h1>{settings.welcomeTitle}</h1>{settings.introImage&&<img class="intro-photo" src={media(settings.introImage)} alt="A personal photograph for our cookbook" width="700" height="500"/>}<p class="about-letter">{settings.welcomeMessage}</p><p class="signature">{settings.signature}</p><hr/><h2>A few little things to know.</h2><p>Start with the ingredients and equipment. Read the whole method once. Then open cooking mode for one clear step at a time. The timeline gives you the bigger picture.</p><p>Your saved recipes, shopping list, checklists and cooking progress are stored on this device. Clearing your browser’s data clears them too.</p><p>Timers use a finish time, so their countdown catches up when you return. Phone browsers may suspend sound in the background; keep the page open and use your phone’s own alarm for anything you must not miss.</p><a class="button" href={url('recipes/')}>Let’s find something to make ↗</a></section></Layout>
